{"id":"word:hebrew:H7272","type":"word","title":"רֶגֶל","subtitle":"H7272 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a foot (as used in walking); by implication, a step ; by euphemistically the pudenda","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to רֶגֶל (H7272) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 251 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"רֶגֶל (regel) means a foot (as used in walking); by implication, a step ; by euphemistically the pudenda First listed occurrence: 1Chr 28 2."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"רֶגֶל","transliteration":"regel","pronunciation":"reh'-gel","strong":"H7272","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7272","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["רַגְלָֽי/ו","רַגְלָ֔י/ו","רֶ֣גֶל","רַגְל֖/וֹ","רַגְלֵ֣י"],"morphs":[["HNcfdc/Sp3ms",34],["HNcfdc/Sp1cs",23],["HR/Ncfdc/Sp3ms",17],["HNcfdc/Sp3mp",15],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",15],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",13],["HNcfdc",11],["HNcfsa",11],["HNcfsc",8],["HNcfdc/Sp3fs",7]]},"definitions":{"short":"a foot (as used in walking); by implication, a step ; by euphemistically the pudenda","usage":"× be able to endure, × according as, × after, × coming, × follow, (broken-)foot(-ed, -stool), × great toe, × haunt, × journey, leg, piss, possession, time.","full":"H7272. regel רֶ֫גֶל 247 noun feminine Deut 8:4 (on suffix masculine Song 5:3 see Kö Synt. § l4 Albr ZAW (xvi, 1896, 76) xv (1895), 316 f. ), foot (Late Hebrew id. ; Arabic , leg, foot ; Aramaic רַגְלָא , foot ; Palmyrene suffix רגלה Lzb 368 ; transposed Zinjirli (plural construct) לגרי Id lb., Mandean ליגרא Nö M 102 ; compare Ethiopic vehicle Di 347 ); — absolute ׳ר Exod 21:24 +, רָ֑גֶל 21:24 +; construct רֶגֶל Num 22:25 +; suffix רַגְלִי Gen 30:30 +, etc.; dual רַגְלָ֫יִם 1Sam 28:3 +, רַנְלָ֑יִם 2Sam 4:4 +; construct רַגְלֵי Gen 24:32 +; suffix רַגְלַי Num 20:19 +, רַגְלֶיךָ Exod 3:5 +, etc.; plural רְגָלִים 23:14 3 t. (see 2 below); — 1 foot: a. human , Gen 18:4 ; 19:2 10 t. of washing feet ( רחץ ); Exod 3:5 ; 4:25 + often; in figure Deut 32:35 ; 1Sam 2:9 ; Jer 2:25 ; Job 12:5 + often; ׳ר נַּאֲוָה Psa 36:12 foot of pride ; לְר ׳הֲדֹם 110:1 ; ר ׳כַּף sole of foot Deut 2:5 ; 11:24 ; 28:56 , 65 6 t., + ראֹשׁ וְעַד ר ׳מִכַּף Isa 1:6 , compare ( קדקד וְעַד ) 2Sam 14:25 ; Deut 28:35 ; Job 2:7 ; also ר וְעַד ׳מֵראֹשׁ Lev 13:12 ; ר ׳שָׁרְשֵׁי Job 13:27 see שֹׁרֶשׁ ; ר ׳אֶצְבְּעוֺת 2Sam 21:20 = toes , ר ׳בֹּהֶן = great toe Judg 1:6-7 , Exod 29:20 6 t. Leviticus; ׳ר = leg 1Sam 17:6 (see also feminine near the end ). b. anthropomorphism of God , Exod 24:10 ; 2Sam 22:10 = Psa 18:10 ; Nahum 1:3 ; Hab 3:5 ; Isa 60:13 ; Zech 14:4 ; ר ׳כַּמּוֺת Ezek 43:7 ; ר ׳הֲדֹם Isa 66:1 ; Lam 2:1 ; 1Chr 28:2 ; Psa 99:5 ; 132:7 . c. of seraphim Isa 6:2 , Ezekiel's חַיּוֺת Ezek 1:7 (twice in verse) and ( ר ׳כֵּף ) 1:7 , cherubim 2Chr 3:13 ; idols Psa 115:7 . d. of animals: dove , ר ׳כַּף Gen 8:9 (J); עוֺף שֶׁרֶץ Lev 11:21 , 23 , שֶׁרֶץ 11:42 ; calf, ר ׳כַּף Ezek 1:7 (in simile), בְּהֵמָה 29:11 ; Pharaoh under figure of תַּנִּים 32:2 ; probably of beast also Job 39:15 , indefinite Isa 28:3 (in figurative). e. of table Exod 25:26 ; 37:13 (P). f. phrases: ׳לְר ( ל ) 5i according to the pace of Gen 33:14 (twice in verse) (J; as fast as cattle, children, can go); at one's guidance Deut 33:8 ; at one's foot , i.e. at every step Gen 30:30 (J), Isa 41:2 , compare Job 18:11 (see I. [ מּוּץ ] Hiph`il ); לְר ׳הלך 1Sam 25:42 , i.e. went where she went, compare 2Sam 15:16-17 , 18 ; ׳בְּר on one's feet , on foot, Num 20:19 (JE), Deut 2:28 ; Judg 4:15 , 17 ; Psa 66:6 , בְּר ׳שֻׁלֵּח Judg 5:15 (see שׁלח ), compare Job 18:8 (and שִׁלֵּח֑וּ רַגְלַי 30:12 ); (הָעָם הַיְקוּם, בְּד, אֲשֶׁר ׳הַבְּהֵמָה) , i.e. which follow one, hence obey or belong to one, Exod 11:8 (J), Judg 4:10 ; 8:5 ; 1Kin 20:10 ; Deut 11:6 ; 2Kin 3:9 , בְּר ׳הַמִּתְהַלְּכִים 1Sam 25:27 ; ר ׳נָשָׂא Gen 29:1 (E) = set out, but אֶתרֿ ׳יָרִים 41:44 (E) lift the foot , i.e. make a movement, do anything; euphemism אֶתרֿ ׳מֵסִיךְ Judg 3:24 , compare 1Sam 24:3 (Gi; van d. H. Baer v. 24:4 ; see I. [ סָכַךְ ] Hiph`il ); אֶתרֿ ׳וַתְּפַשְּׂקִי לְ Ezek 16:25 (see פשׂק ); ר מִבֵּין ׳הַיּוֺצֵת Deut 28:57 (see יצא 1h ); ר ׳מֵימֵי Qr 2Kin 18:27 = Isa 36:12 (Kt שיניהם ; see מַיִם 3 ); ׳הָר שַׂעַר 7:20 , i.e. hair of the private parts. 2 plural only in phrase רְגָלִים שָׁלשׁ three times (feet, paces, compare מַּעַם ) Exod 23:14 (E), Num 22:28 , 32 , 33 (J).","rootNote":"from 7270 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 28 2","keyReferences":["1Chr 28 2","1Chr 28 2","1Kgs 2 5","1Kgs 5 17","1Kgs 5 17","1Kgs 14 6","1Kgs 14 12","1Kgs 15 23"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":251,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 28 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רַגְלָ֔י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רַגְלֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/רַגְלָֽי/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfdc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 17","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רגל/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 17","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רַגְלָֽ/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 14 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רַגְלֶ֨י/הָ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 14 12","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רַגְלַ֛יִ/ךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc/Sp2fs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 15 23","book":"1Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רַגְלָֽי/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"